<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT BRAZIL 4-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT BRAZIL 4-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway beat Brazil 4-2 (halftime 3-1) in a soccer friendly on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Norway - Petter Rudi 9, Tor Andre Flo 17, 32, Egil Oestenstad 77</p>
<p>Brazil - Dhalminha 20, Romario 68 </p>
<p>Attendance: 21,799</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Norway: 1-Frode Grodaas (12-Thomas Gill 46) 2-Alf Inge Haaland (14-Gunnar Halle 46), 3-Ronny Johnsen, 4-Henning Berg, 5-Bent Skammelsrud, 6-Frank Strandli, 7-Erik Mykland, 8-Oeyvind Leonardsen (17-Staale Solbakken 46), 9-Tore Andre Flo, 10-Ketil Rekdal, 11-Petter Rudi (18-Egil Oestenstad 46).</p>
<p>Brazil: 1-Taffarel, 2-Cafu, 3-Celio Silva, 4-Marcio Santos, 5-Mauro Silva, 6-Roberto Carlos, 7-Djalminha, 8-Dunga, 9-Ronaldo, 10-Leonardo, 11-Romario.</p>
</text>
